  "source_note": [
    "Paths are relative to the repository root, not to this file. The",
    "committed marks live in brand/, which is outside the overlay mount, so",
    "generate_icons.py resolves the repository root through the mount and",
    "emits a depfile naming every master it read.",
    "",
    "The on-dark colour mark is the master for every colour asset: a launcher",
    "composites the icon over a surface it owns, so the treatment designed",
    "for dark surfaces is the one that keeps the ribbon's gradient intact.",
    "",
    "role=launcher assets carry TaffyGo's own resource names and feed",
    ":branding_resources. role=override assets shadow upstream resource",
    "names by resource-overlay precedence and feed :image_override_resources \u2014 the",
    "substitution decision 0019 and patch spec 0002 record. The names in",
    "check-shadowed-names (tools/check_shadowed_names.py) must stay in step.",
    "",
    "content_scale 0.611 is the adaptive-icon safe zone: 66dp of visible",
    "content on a 108dp layer (66/108). A layer rendered full-bleed would be",
    "cropped by every launcher mask.",
    "",
    "monochrome_alpha assets are masks: the launcher or the notification",
    "shade recolours them, so the colour channels are forced to white and",
    "only the alpha carries the mark (png_io.to_monochrome_alpha).",
    "",
    "launcher assets live under res/ and override assets under res_overrides/:",
    "the two android_resources targets must own disjoint resource roots,",
    "because prepare_resources.py refuses any file it finds in a target's",
    "root that the target's own sources list does not name."
  ],
